Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:24.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nao-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:28.42,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Oh, leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:30.08,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:32.65,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Did you pack all the gifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.65,0:00:33.49,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.49,0:00:35.27,Default,NAO,0,0,0,,Say hi to everyone for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:36.22,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:38.72,DefaultItalics,PA,0,0,0,,The train will arrive shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:18.23,DefaultItalics,PA,0,0,0,,Thank you for flying with us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:23.10,DefaultItalics,PA,0,0,0,,Please remain seated with your seatbelt \Nfastened while the seatbelt sign is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:47.21,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,So many people... Think we'll find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:49.95,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Oh, is that her? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:51.85,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.67,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,What's up with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:57.39,Default,MITSUMIDAD,0,0,0,,She's puttin' on big-city airs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:01.55,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,Nobody changes that much in four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.35,Default,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,I'll carry your suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:06.95,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:08.06,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:12.22,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,Notice how there wasn't any corn \Nin the last care package?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:13.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:17.56,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,There was so much rain this year, \Nwe couldn't grow anything decent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.56,0:04:21.44,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,There were so many civets, too. \NWe might just skip it next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:24.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.55,0:04:29.12,Default,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,Grandma! Sis is home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:31.12,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Wow, candies! So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:33.09,Default,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,Thanks, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:36.78,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,For Mom and Dad, keychains and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.27,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Apparently, this yokan's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.27,0:04:42.34,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,My, you didn't have to get us all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.75,0:04:44.54,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,Is Nao-chan working today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:48.62,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,Then I'll call to thank her later tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:50.41,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Dad, where's Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.41,0:04:52.08,Default,MITSUMIDAD,0,0,0,,Cooking red rice in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.99,0:04:58.16,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Grandma, I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:05:00.99,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Mitsumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:05.22,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,I heard you'd be back, so I figured \NI'd make us somethin' special.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:08.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What? You didn't need to go to the trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:12.71,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,Well, truth told, it's just \Nan excuse so I can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.01,0:05:21.71,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,You splash on a lot of water and \Nsteam it for ten more minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:24.21,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll set a timer and keep an eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:28.34,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,Oh? Didn't know it could do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:29.91,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's real handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.95,0:05:32.77,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,I'll check on my tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.22,0:05:34.62,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:38.01,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,Cover up yer legs or them \Nskeeters'll suck them dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:47.15,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,The first scoop is for \Nthe gods and the spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:55.54,Default,MITSUMIGRANDMA,0,0,0,,Take the rest to the dinin' room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:56.62,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:12.31,Default,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,Hey! That's bad manners, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:15.77,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,A little bit of bad manners adds flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:17.02,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.36,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sea bream sashimi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:24.48,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What, we already having a feast for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.65,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:31.28,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad kept talking \Nabout what to feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:15.05,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Sis. Your phone's ringing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.63,0:07:19.23,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.25,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:23.54,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Fumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:26.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's Fumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:29.05,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,It's Mitsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:33.55,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,The gang wanted to get together \Nsince you were coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.84,0:07:37.81,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,They're all in front of the shrine already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.81,0:07:41.69,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd see all our \Nmiddle school mates right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.69,0:07:45.57,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Yukko's dad says he'll drive everyone \Nwho came far back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.57,0:07:46.68,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:49.57,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,He's chatting with my pa now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:55.36,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I was gonna ask if I could have \Nsome big ol' fireworks tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:58.66,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Mitsumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:05.88,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,I'm going out with that boy \NI told you about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:06.97,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:11.42,DefaultTop,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wait, for real?! Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.89,0:08:12.63,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Thanks... but keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.63,0:08:14.23,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Since when? When?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.23,0:08:17.20,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,S-Start of summer break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:23.24,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,I knew I wouldn't see him for a bit, \Nso I asked for his contact deets.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:25.15,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,We texted for a while, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.66,0:08:40.41,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Do the others know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.81,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Naw. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.81,0:08:45.92,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,I wanted you to be the first to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:52.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Fumi-san, have you gotten \Nprettier, perchance?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.47,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Oh, you! What about yourself, Mitsumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:56.55,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:08:58.77,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,Ooh, they're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:08:59.72,Default,CLASSMATE,0,0,0,,Mitsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:01.20,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,You doin' all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:01.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.48,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,You ain't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:07.79,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm classier now. Though \NI guess you wouldn't get it, Tacchan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:10.68,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,I see yer wearing the same shirt \Nfrom middle school, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.18,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,Oh, it's lit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:46.24,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, did ya quit \Npracticin' your Standard Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:49.69,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:10:01.99,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I found friends that won't \Nmake fun of me over my dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:02.93,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,So it's whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.73,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,There's a whole rocket in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:06.79,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:08.53,Default,TACCHAN,0,0,0,,Heck yeah! Light her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:09.68,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:28.10,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Sis still ain't up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:30.44,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,She used to wake up second after Grandma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:32.46,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Should I wake her up? \NFumi-chan will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:34.94,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,Let her sleep while she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.94,0:10:39.12,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,She probably just feels free now she's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.92,0:10:46.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Goo mong...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:50.40,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,'Bout time! Want some toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.47,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:55.11,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Ate too much yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.11,0:10:56.27,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,Watermelon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:58.54,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.35,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.25,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Mom, what 'bout work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:05.58,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,I took a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:08.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Thanks, but you didn't hafta.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:09.63,Default,MITSUMIMOM,0,0,0,,I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:00.28,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Mornin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:03.14,Default,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,Sis, Fumi-chan's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:04.85,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Huh? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:06.49,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's that time already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:10.52,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sorry, Fumi! I'll be right out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.52,0:12:13.49,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,What's this? You never \Noversleep, Mitsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:15.88,Default,MAHARU,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:50.80,Default,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:53.62,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But it's so cute! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.98,0:12:59.06,Default,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.25,0:13:09.60,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Summer break is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.43,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,and we're back to school today!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:13.87,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:15.27,Default,LADY,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.78,0:13:16.77,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:21.94,Flashback,KIPPEI,0,0,0,,You'll miss your plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:24.61,Flashback,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:27.97,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I cried a little, but that's all in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:29.08,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.74,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:33.03,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm Iwakura Mitsumi, fifteen years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:35.25,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And I'm back to being a city girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:46.18,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hey, Mitsumi-chan. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:49.94,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:55.63,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, just thinking how it's a good omen \Nthat you're the first classmate I saw today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:58.60,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.16,0:14:01.61,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You've really tanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:04.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Right? I went to the beach \Nevery day back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.78,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,A little to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.35,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's Kanechika-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.35,0:14:09.03,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Okay, that will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.70,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Senpai! Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:14.16,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi-kun, Shima-kun! Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:16.30,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Preparing for the school festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.30,0:14:17.00,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:21.63,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,We're making all the big props first \Nto get people motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:27.70,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,And it can only be a good sign \Nthat I saw Shima-kun so soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.70,0:14:30.21,DefaultItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,What am I, some kind of good luck charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:32.34,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Hang on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:37.12,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Here's the script \Nfor our school festival play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:40.17,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,It's one of my best works to date!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.17,0:14:44.98,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not recruiting you. \NIt's already been cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:47.36,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,But could you give it a read?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:50.03,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,I just want to hear your thoughts on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.33,0:14:58.12,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,If I take this, you'll think I'm interested \Nand start bugging me again, right, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.00,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:13.67,Default,NARUMI,0,0,0,,Do come see the play, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.31,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.31,0:15:18.56,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yuzu-chan! Makocchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:21.21,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You're back! And look at that tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.21,0:15:23.92,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Makocchan, did you get paler instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.81,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.18,0:15:27.03,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Mika-chan! Good mor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.41,0:15:29.41,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:31.24,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Cookies from a famous place in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.24,0:15:32.99,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Give one to Nao-san, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:35.86,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.97,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks! So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.97,0:15:41.17,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,When did you and Nao-chan get so friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:43.75,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Urk. L-Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.09,0:15:45.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.89,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.89,0:15:49.51,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,My hometown's famous squid crackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.41,0:15:52.26,Default,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.41,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,You eat everything you get right away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:56.58,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I have some for Shima-kun \Nand the others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.22,0:15:59.45,DefaultTop,KENTO,0,0,0,,Hey, any stories of romance \Nover summer break?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:15:59.85,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, just missed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:00.38,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:02.54,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,You'll have plenty of chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:22.35,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Watanabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:23.58,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Thanks for the notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.58,0:16:24.54,Default,WATANABE,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:26.55,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,You got a girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.55,0:16:27.99,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,Pics or it didn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.99,0:16:29.09,Default,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.09,0:16:31.27,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Gah! She's even cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:33.17,Default,ENOMOTO,0,0,0,,Maybe I should join a band, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:35.38,Default,NARUSE,0,0,0,,Hey, music ain't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.25,0:16:37.20,Default,KATOU,0,0,0,,How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.94,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Summer break in high school \Nseems to pass by so quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.06,Default,KOHARU,0,0,0,,Wow, you tanned a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:45.70,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,...but it's also a month of transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.69,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Some people get a partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.55,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,while others lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.45,0:16:54.30,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Some gain composure,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.96,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,while others lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:58.80,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Those cookies were so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.80,0:16:59.74,Default,MIKA,0,0,0,,Right? They're my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:00.96,DefaultTop,MAKOTO,0,0,0,,They're crazy good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.15,0:17:01.88,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Some grow closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.47,Default,YUZUKI,0,0,0,,Mitsumi, did you try it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.47,0:17:04.37,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.25,DefaultTop,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I'd asked Watanabe beforehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.63,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,...while others drift away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.63,DefaultTop,SUDA,0,0,0,,I was counting on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.08,0:17:14.67,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Are you vibing to the max, Mitsumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:17.05,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,"Vibing"? "Max"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:20.23,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,I mean, are you excited and motivated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:24.11,Default,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,The student council will be very \Nbusy with the school festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:25.79,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:29.83,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Our school festival is open \Nto the public. It's a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.83,0:17:32.25,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,You've probably never seen \Nanything like it, Iwakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.58,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.58,0:17:35.95,DefaultItalics,TOKIKO,0,0,0,,Talk about condescending.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.27,0:17:42.07,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,Thank you, class and club representatives, \Nfor being here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.07,0:17:46.46,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,The deadline for festival applications \Nis the end of this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.96,0:17:50.41,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,There are many restrictions \Ninvolved, particularly for F&B.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.41,0:17:55.47,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,I'd like to go over the restrictions \Nand requirements in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:18:01.90,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,As you are aware, prospective students \Nand their parents will attend the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.90,0:18:05.76,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,We'll go over the placement \Nof staff that can act as guides.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:07.68,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,Please direct them to those locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.68,0:18:10.13,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,Gas canisters for balloon art,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.46,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,power supplies for lighting and neon signs,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:16.49,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,large mascot costumes, and many other \Nthings will require special permission...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.44,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It really is a massive deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.82,0:18:24.69,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,What do I do with these feelings of joy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.69,0:18:27.00,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,If I tell Fumi, it'll be like showing off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.00,0:18:29.75,DefaultItalics,FUMINO,0,0,0,,Wow, sounds like a lotta fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:30.63,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:32.38,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's Shima-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:34.51,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Whoa, great timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.51,0:18:36.97,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Is he going home now? I want to talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:39.72,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Is he busy? Would I be a bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:45.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Senpai! \NI'll be back in ten minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.35,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I'll get the materials ready after I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.74,0:18:48.98,Default,HIROTO,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:04.95,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Just because you haven't talked for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:08.09,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,you get afraid that they \Nmight not like you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.09,0:19:11.96,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,But when you're really happy, \Nyou want to share it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.97,0:19:14.53,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.53,0:19:16.46,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Shima-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:18.86,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:19.72,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:23.22,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,This... squid crackers... hometown...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.64,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:29.77,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:33.96,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Did you know that our school festival \Ngets nearly 7,000 attendees every year?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.40,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's practically a concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.96,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Really? Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:38.35,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Isn't it amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:40.18,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,We had a meeting about it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:44.59,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's all so crazy! Like, the strategy \Nfor staff placement and handling guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.59,0:19:46.26,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's the spirit of hospitality, \Nthrough and through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:47.23,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:49.01,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:52.29,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It'll be covered in ads and balloons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.50,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,There's even a decoration contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.40,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Mhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:57.54,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,And then, over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:03.10,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Sorry, you probably don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:05.76,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I just wanted to share \Nmy excitement with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:08.47,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You really love these kinds of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:13.51,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I mean, I thought you only saw these \Nfancy school festivals in TV shows!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.18,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,It's so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.93,0:20:21.19,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Oh, but I guess a class rep can't \Nbe acting like a giddy schoolgirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:23.07,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Hey, it's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:25.66,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I need to be a cool and \Ncomposed adult like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:27.78,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You think too much of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:31.75,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.62,Default,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.70,DefaultItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Mitsumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.31,0:20:41.76,Flashback,RIRIKA,0,0,0,,So don't think you have any right to have \Na fun little high school life of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.63,0:20:45.78,DefaultItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,I get frozen in place because \NI don't deserve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:50.84,DefaultItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,But you guys keep pushing on, \Nfull steam ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:21:01.05,DefaultItalics,SOUSUKE,0,0,0,,You're so dazzling... and so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.80,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,Actually, you seem down, \Nso I'll give you three!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:17.14,Default,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:43.07,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,With school festival prep, \NSeptember will pass in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:44.75,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,That'll mean the end of summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.75,0:21:47.07,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,leaving only two seasons \Nbefore the year's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.31,0:21:53.09,DefaultItalics,MITSUMI,0,0,0,,I hope we can cherish \Nand enjoy the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:57.33,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,With all the votes in, it's decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.33,0:22:00.08,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,Class 3 will be putting on a play!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:01.96,Default,NISHINO,0,0,0,,It's gonna be tough, but let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:03.94,Default,KENTO,0,0,0,,Let's do this, do this, do this, yeah!

